sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin
    participant CF as Cloudflare Access
    participant Web as cctv-web
    participant API as cctv-api
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Gateway
    participant Audit as Audit Log

    Admin->>CF: Open admin area
    CF->>Web: Forward authenticated request
    Web->>API: Submit admin action
    API->>API: Verify CF Access JWT and RBAC
    API->>DB: Apply allowed camera, gateway, user, or ACL change
    API->>Audit: Append admin action event
    alt Gateway-impacting change
        API->>Gateway: Send signed command over outbound channel
        Gateway-->>API: Acknowledge command result
        API->>Audit: Append gateway command result
    end
    API-->>Web: Return action result
    Web-->>Admin: Show confirmation or error state
